{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "实时协作任务看板 API",
    "description": "基于 Next.js + SSE 的实时协作项目管理与任务追踪系统 API 文档\n\n## 认证说明\n\n所有受保护的 API 端点都需要通过 NextAuth.js v5 进行身份验证。\n\n- **认证方式**: Cookie-based Session\n- **未登录响应**: 401 Unauthorized\n- **无权限响应**: 403 Forbidden\n\n## 错误响应格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": \"错误信息\"\n}\n```\n\n## 成功响应格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\n## 实时通信 (SSE)\n\n项目使用 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 实现实时同步：\n\n- **连接地址**: `GET /api/projects/{id}/events`\n- **心跳间隔**: 30秒\n- **事件类型**: card:created, card:updated, card:moved, card:deleted, member:added, member:removed",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "API Support"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "本地开发环境"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Projects",
      "description": "项目管理相关接口"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cards",
      "description": "卡片管理相关接口"
    },
    {
      "name": "Members",
      "description": "项目成员管理接口"
    },
    {
      "name": "Realtime",
      "description": "实时通信相关接口"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/projects": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Projects"],
        "summary": "获取当前用户的项目列表",
        "description": "返回当前登录用户参与的所有项目，包含角色、成员数、列数等信息",
        "operationId": "listProjects",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功获取项目列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponseProjectList"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "cookieAuth": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Projects"],
        "summary": "创建新项目",
        "description": "创建新项目并自动添加当前用户为 ADMIN，同时创建默认的三个列（待办、进行中、已完成）",
        "operationId": "createProject",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["name"],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "项目名称",
                    "example": "我的项目"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "nullable": true,
                    "description": "项目描述",
                    "example": "这是一个示例项目"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "项目创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiResponseProject"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "项目名称为空",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "cookieAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
