    "/api/projects/{id}/events": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Realtime"],
        "summary": "SSE 实时事件流",
        "description": "建立 Server-Sent Events 连接以接收项目的实时更新通知\n\n## 事件类型\n\n- **connected**: 连接建立成功\n- **card:created**: 卡片创建\n- **card:updated**: 卡片更新\n- **card:moved**: 卡片移动\n- **card:deleted**: 卡片删除\n- **member:added**: 成员添加\n- **member:removed**: 成员移除\n\n## 心跳机制\n\n服务器每 30 秒发送一次心跳以保持连接活跃\n\n## 响应头\n\n```\nContent-Type: text/event-stream\nCache-Control: no-cache\nConnection: keep-alive\n```",
        "operationId": "subscribeToEvents",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "项目 ID",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SSE 连接建立成功",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "event: connected\ndata: {\"userId\":\"usr_abc123\"}\n\n: heartbeat\n\nevent: card:created\ndata: {...}\n\n"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权访问该项目"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "cookieAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
